WEBVTT

00:01:58.954 --> 00:02:01.204
but it can also be very rewarding.

00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:03.663
Experiments have shown
that shared vulnerability

00:02:03.704 --> 00:02:07.246
establishes a greater
sense of trust, cooperation

00:02:07.246 --> 00:02:09.288
and intimacy in relationships.

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:10.621
So to get you started,

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.704
I, along with a couple of colleagues,

00:02:12.704 --> 00:02:15.496
developed a list
of 10 conversation starters.

00:02:15.538 --> 00:02:16.704
Here are just three.

00:02:16.704 --> 00:02:17.871
Number one:

00:02:17.913 --> 00:02:19.913
What are your long-term financial goals?

00:02:19.954 --> 00:02:22.246
What do you want to accomplish together?

00:02:22.288 --> 00:02:23.413
Number two:

00:02:23.454 --> 00:02:25.621
How do you measure your financial success?

00:02:25.663 --> 00:02:27.746
Is it a house with a white picket fence,

00:02:27.788 --> 00:02:31.246
or is it having the ability to live
anywhere around the globe?